      "text_preview": "As per the dictum laid down by the Hon'ble Apex Court in State of Punjab and others vs. Rafiq Masih (White Washer) reported in AIR 2015 SC 696."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "702f9443247f4644a7a08bdb3e4bb092_12",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In which, the Hon'ble Apex Court has laid down the guidelines for recovery in the following manner:-\nhttps://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis (i)Recovery from employees belonging to Class-III and Class-IV service (or Group 'C'\nand Group 'D' service)"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3021a89a00fc48ec88a46da99be182df_13",
