      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nP.Titus Fernando vs The State Of Tamil Nadu on 10 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/44852348/\n2"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0fe87820031f4ed39e6b3a60c5e5ca0a_14",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(ii)Recovery from retired employees, or employees who are due to retire within one year, of the order of recovery."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "23f413ad774a428c9b3dd0ccca077686_15",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(iii)Recovery from employees, when the excess payment has been made for a period in excess of five years, before the order of recovery is issued."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2077a43b06a947668fce404aa8e2d608_16",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(iv)Recovery in cases where an employee has wrongfully been required to discharge duties of a higher post, and has been paid accordingly, even though he should have rightfully been required to work against an inferior post."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f4da7cc79a6e451eaae5e516034a12b9_17",
